---
import BaseLayout from '../components/layout/BaseLayout.astro';
import Navbar from '../components/layout/Navbar.astro';
import Footer from '../components/layout/Footer.astro';
import InlineCTA from '../components/sections/InlineCTA.astro';
import BreadcrumbSchema from '../components/schema/BreadcrumbSchema.astro';
import AdvertisingAgencySchema from '../components/schema/AdvertisingAgencySchema.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../data/business';

const pageDescription =
  'A local advertising agency in Prosper, TX that actually picks up the phone. Local Business Spotlights, Meta Ads, and Google Ads management built around your Google Business Profile.';

const breadcrumbItems = [
  { name: 'Home', url: siteConfig.siteUrl },
  { name: 'Advertising Agency', url: `${siteConfig.siteUrl}/advertising-agency/` },
];

const services = [
  'Local Business Spotlight',
  'Meta Ads',
  'Google Ads',
  'Local SEO',
  'Google Business Profile Optimization',
];

const trustPoints = [
  'Local marketing agency in Prosper',
  'No handoffs — you work with me directly',
  'I pick up the phone',
  'Results obsessed',
];

// Shared prose styling so section bodies match the rest of the site.
const proseClass =
  'prose prose-lg max-w-none text-text-muted [&>p]:mt-4 [&>p]:text-base [&>p]:leading-relaxed [&_a]:font-semibold [&_a]:text-primary [&_a:hover]:text-primary-dark';

const intro = [
  `If you run a business here in Prosper, you already know how it goes. You're great at what you do, but getting people to actually see you online feels like a different language. I get it. I'm Inside Prosper, and I'm a local marketing agency right here in the area, not some big corporation that's gonna hand your account off to a virtual assistant in another country.`,
  `Here's the honest truth about working with an advertising agency in Prosper. Most of them ghost you. I've heard it over and over from business owners who came to me after getting burned. They couldn't even get their old agency on the phone. That's not how I do things. There's no big team under me. It's just me, doing the work, overseeing everything, and answering when you reach out.`,
  `The whole goal is simple. Get your business showing up when people in Prosper search for what you do. I've got a really good process around getting you into the Map Pack, and a big part of that is advertising done the right way for a local business. Not a national blog style approach that doesn't work anymore. Hyper local, focused on this area, built around your Google Business Profile so everything works together and builds trust with Google.`,
];

// The main advertising services, in the order they're introduced.
const sections = [
  {
    id: 'local-business-spotlight',
    title: 'Local Business Spotlight',
    html: `
<p>This is where a lot of folks first find me. The Local Business Spotlight is exactly what it sounds like. I write an article about your business, get to know you a little, learn what makes you different, and share your business with the local community for free. Sometimes I sit down with the owner and we go through it together. It's a real way to get your name out there in Prosper without it feeling like a sales pitch.</p>
<p>What I like about the Spotlight is that it's genuine. People in the area get to actually know your story, not just see another ad. And it puts you in front of the exact people who live and shop around here. If you've ever wondered how to get more local eyes on your business without spending a fortune, this is a great place to start.</p>`,
  },
  {
    id: 'meta-ads-management',
    title: 'Meta Ads Management',
    html: `
<p>Facebook and Instagram ads can move the needle fast when they're set up right, and they can also burn through your budget when they're not. That's the part most business owners don't see coming. Meta Ads management is about making every dollar count, targeting the right people in Prosper and the surrounding area, and watching what's actually working so we can do more of it.</p>
<p>I take a hands on approach here. I'm not setting it and forgetting it. I'm watching how your ads perform, who's clicking, and adjusting as we go. The point is to get you real leads from people nearby who actually need what you offer, not just likes that don't pay the bills. For a local business, that local targeting is everything.</p>`,
  },
  {
    id: 'google-ads-management',
    title: 'Google Ads Management',
    html: `
<p>When somebody in Prosper pulls out their phone and searches for your service right now, they're ready to buy. Google Ads puts you right at the top of that search the moment they're looking. That's the power of it. The trouble is, Google Ads gets expensive quick if it's run sloppy, and a lot of businesses give up on it because nobody managed it properly.</p>
<p>Google Ads management with me means your budget goes toward the searches that actually bring in customers. I keep an eye on what's converting, cut what's wasting money, and keep your ads pointed at the people most likely to call you. Paired with everything else we do to rank you locally, it's a strong way to fill your pipeline while the longer term local SEO work builds up underneath it.</p>`,
  },
];

const whyChooseHtml = `
<p>Here's what makes me different. I'm a local business myself. I've met plenty of owners around here in person, sat down with them, built real relationships. A lot of agencies are just online now and don't do anything face to face. I'd rather meet you, build that trust, and treat this like a partnership instead of just a number on an invoice.</p>
<p>I'm also not the cheapest, and I won't pretend to be. But I keep it reasonable for local businesses because I know what it's like. Paying thousands and thousands every month to an agency while keeping a small business afloat isn't easy, and I'm not gonna charge you an arm and a leg.</p>
<p>And I'm results obsessed. That's just how I'm wired. When I take something on, I want to be the best at it, and that goes double for what I do for my clients. A good example is Rankin Waste Management. We took them from 10 reviews to over 250 five star Google reviews in about a month. That's the kind of obsession I bring to every business I work with.</p>`;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Advertising Agency in Prosper, TX | Inside Prosper"
  description={pageDescription}
>
  <AdvertisingAgencySchema services={services} description={pageDescription} />
  <BreadcrumbSchema items={breadcrumbItems} />
  <Navbar />
  <main>
    <!-- Hero -->
    <section class="bg-bg-dark pt-32 pb-16 lg:pt-40 lg:pb-20">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-6">
        <nav class="mb-8 flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-white/40" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
          <a href="/" class="transition-colors hover:text-primary">Home</a>
          <svg class="size-3.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7" /></svg>
          <span class="text-white/70">Advertising Agency</span>
        </nav>

        <span class="mb-4 inline-block text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-primary">
          Local Marketing Agency
        </span>
        <h1 class="font-heading text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl">
          Advertising Agency in Prosper That Actually <span class="font-display italic text-primary">Gets You Found</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base text-white/60 sm:text-lg">
          A local marketing agency that picks up the phone, knows the area, and actually cares whether you win.
        </p>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col gap-3 sm:flex-row">
          <a
            href={`tel:${siteConfig.phoneRaw}`}
            class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-7 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-primary-dark"
          >
            <svg class="size-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 3.5A1.5 1.5 0 013.5 2h1.148a1.5 1.5 0 011.465 1.175l.716 3.223a1.5 1.5 0 01-1.052 1.767l-.933.267c-.41.117-.643.555-.48.95a11.542 11.542 0 006.254 6.254c.395.163.833-.07.95-.48l.267-.933a1.5 1.5 0 011.767-1.052l3.223.716A1.5 1.5 0 0118 15.352V16.5a1.5 1.5 0 01-1.5 1.5H15c-1.149 0-2.263-.15-3.326-.43A13.022 13.022 0 012.43 8.326 13.019 13.019 0 012 5V3.5z" /></svg>
            Call Now {siteConfig.phone}
          </a>
          <a
            href="/"
            class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/25 px-7 py-3 text-base font-semibold text-white transition-colors hover:bg-white/10"
          >
            Explore Businesses
          </a>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-3">
          {trustPoints.map((point) => (
            <span class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/10 bg-white/10 px-4 py-1.5 text-sm text-white/80 backdrop-blur-sm">
              <svg class="size-4 shrink-0 text-primary" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2.5" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7" /></svg>
              {point}
            </span>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Intro -->
    <section class="bg-bg py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
        <div class="space-y-5 text-base leading-relaxed text-text-muted">
          {intro.map((para) => <p>{para}</p>)}
        </div>
        <p class="mt-8 font-heading text-lg font-bold text-text">
          Below are the main advertising services I help local businesses with.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Services -->
    <section class="bg-bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl space-y-16 px-6">
        {sections.map((s) => (
          <div id={s.id} class="scroll-mt-28">
            <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-4xl">
              {s.title}
            </h2>
            <div class={`mt-6 ${proseClass}`} set:html={s.html} />
          </div>
        ))}
      </div>
    </section>

    <InlineCTA heading="Need an advertising agency that picks up the phone?" subheading="Call Inside Prosper and talk to the person doing the work." />

    <!-- Why choose -->
    <section id="why-inside-prosper" class="scroll-mt-28 bg-bg-white py-16 lg:py-24">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-text sm:text-4xl">
          Why Local Businesses Pick Inside Prosper
        </h2>
        <div class={`mt-6 ${proseClass}`} set:html={whyChooseHtml} />
        <p class="mt-6 text-lg font-semibold text-text">
          If you want an advertising agency in Prosper that picks up the phone, knows the area, and actually cares whether you win, that's me.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Bottom CTA -->
    <section class="bg-bg-dark py-20 text-center">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6">
        <h2 class="font-heading text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">
          Ready to Get <span class="text-primary">Found</span>?
        </h2>
        <p class="mt-4 text-base text-white/60">
          Talk to the person who'll actually do the work. Call {siteConfig.phone} today.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-3 sm:flex-row sm:flex-wrap">
          <a
            href={`tel:${siteConfig.phoneRaw}`}
            class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-primary px-8 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-primary-dark"
          >
            <svg class="size-5" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 3.5A1.5 1.5 0 013.5 2h1.148a1.5 1.5 0 011.465 1.175l.716 3.223a1.5 1.5 0 01-1.052 1.767l-.933.267c-.41.117-.643.555-.48.95a11.542 11.542 0 006.254 6.254c.395.163.833-.07.95-.48l.267-.933a1.5 1.5 0 011.767-1.052l3.223.716A1.5 1.5 0 0118 15.352V16.5a1.5 1.5 0 01-1.5 1.5H15c-1.149 0-2.263-.15-3.326-.43A13.022 13.022 0 012.43 8.326 13.019 13.019 0 012 5V3.5z" /></svg>
            Call Now {siteConfig.phone}
          </a>
          <a
            href="/"
            class="inline-flex min-h-12 items-center justify-center gap-2 rounded-full border border-white/25 px-8 py-3.5 font-semibold text-white transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-white/10"
          >
            Explore Businesses
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</BaseLayout>
